            Definition(name: "replace_text", title: "Find and replace words",
                       description: "Finds words in the design's text layers (those that can be seen, every post of a deck, every cell of a grid) and puts others in their place, keeping how the letters looked. One step of the undo history. Without replace, only lists where they were found.",
                       properties: .object([
                           design,
                           ("find", Self.text("The words to look for.")),
                           ("replace", Self.text("What to put in their place. Leave it out to only find.")),
